  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Give four writings of the same date. Only the commas change. Only one writing is right.",
      "Never change the month, day number, year, or weekday across the four choices.",
      "Wrong choices leave out a needed comma, put a comma after the month, add an extra comma, or skip the weekday comma.",
      "Month plus day only is right with no comma. Month plus year only is right with no comma.",
      "A weekday plus a date needs a comma after the weekday. A weekday plus month, day, and year needs a comma after the weekday and a comma after the day.",
      "Keep dates in kid life at home, school, play, family, food, or pets. Use years from 2016 to 2026. Never use famous history dates.",
      "Never use a real name in a stem. Use <NAME> with swap_slots. Do not name or describe a picture in the stem.",
      "One tap and one right answer. Keep every stem at ten words or fewer from the roots list, allowed extra words, or <NAME>."
    ]
  },
